export const categories=[['all','全部图案','All designs'],['nature','花卉自然','Nature'],['travel','风景旅行','Travel'],['cute','可爱贴纸','Playful'],['graphic','文字抽象','Graphic'],['favorites','我的收藏','Favorites']];
export const baseDesign=()=>({art:'bloom',image:'',style:'original',zoom:100,caption:'',enhance:false,background:'#fef4e8',layers:[]});
export function designFor(id){const d=baseDesign();d.art='solid';d.templateId=id;
 const layer=(type,value,x,y,size,rotation=0)=>({id:`${id}-${d.layers.length}`,type,x,y,size,rotation,...(type==='text'?{text:value,color:'#283637',font:'serif'}:type==='image'?{src:value}:{asset:value})});
 const add=(...args)=>d.layers.push(layer(...args));
 if(['garden','ocean','cherry','cosmos'].includes(id)){add('image',`./flow-assets/designs/${id}.webp`,50,52,90);}
 const original={bloom:['daisy','#30b7b9','bloom.'],sunset:['sun','#fbd2b4','slow moments.'],type:['sparkle','#fef4e8','MAKE'],abstract:['wave','#dfd4f2','a little different.']};
 if(original[id]){const[asset,bg,text]=original[id];d.background=bg;if(id==='type'){for(const[v,y]of [['MAKE',38],['IT',53],['YOURS.',68]]){add('text',v,50,y,85);d.layers.at(-1).font='sans';d.layers.at(-1).color='#e44592';}}else{add('sticker',asset,73,30,60,-12);add('sticker',id==='sunset'?'wave':asset,36,66,75,10);add('text',text,51,85,69);} }
 const themes={cats:['cat','#f8e4ec'],puppies:['dog','#fff0d7'],butterflies:['butterfly','#e4f4f2'],sunshine:['sun','#fff2bd'],love:['heart','#fbe7ed'],orbit:['rocket','#e5e2f5'],petals:['blossom','#edf5e5'],rainbows:['rainbow','#fdf1e2']};
 if(themes[id]){const [asset,bg]=themes[id];d.art='solid';d.background=bg;d.layers=[[70,26,-12],[30,48,12],[73,64,-8],[32,83,10]].map(([x,y,rotation],j)=>({id:`${id}-${j}`,type:'sticker',asset,x,y,rotation,size:33}));}
 const newer={'daisy-day':['daisy','#f9e9eb','bloom with me'],'ribbon-note':['bow','#fef4e8','a little love'],'citrus':['orange','#edf4e5','slow sunday'],'soft-cloud':['cloud','#d8eef1','head in the clouds'],'forest':['mushroom','#e3ebdf','take it slowly'],'check-love':['checker','#ffe8ef','MAKE IT YOURS'],'spring-letter':['tulip','#f8eee1','dear spring'],'ocean-note':['wave','#dcefeb','meet me by the sea'],'smile-club':['smile','#fef4e8','GOOD DAYS'],'star-letter':['sparkle','#ece4f7','stay curious'],'minimal-heart':['heart-line','#ffffff','always with you'],'sunny-photo':['sunflower','#fff1d4','MOMENTS']};
 if(newer[id]){const[asset,bg,text]=newer[id];d.background=bg;add('sticker',asset,72,29,42,-8);add('sticker',asset,31,53,47,12);add('sticker',asset,73,72,33,-8);add('text',text,50,88,70);}
 const creatorId=['mika','noah','popomo'][Math.max(0,templates.findIndex(t=>t.id===id))%3];d.source={contentId:'case-'+id,creatorId,version:1};for(const l of d.layers)if(l.type==='sticker')l.source={contentId:'sticker-'+l.asset,creatorId:stickers.find(a=>a.id===l.asset)?.creatorId||'popomo',version:1};
 return d;
}
export function matchingTemplates(category='all',query='',favorites=[]){const q=query.trim().toLowerCase();return templates.filter(t=>(category==='all'||category==='favorites'&&favorites.includes(t.id)||category===t.category)&&(!q||(t.zh+' '+t.en).toLowerCase().includes(q)));}
